# ---- console (required) ----
# Your harness-console deployment (Cloudflare Worker) + its shared bearer secret.
# Joining an existing fleet: get these values from the fleet operator.
# Running your own fleet: deploy the console first (see docs/OPERATOR-SETUP.md §3).
CONSOLE_URL=https://<your-console>.workers.dev
HARNESS_SECRET=<long-random-string-shared-with-the-console>

